    "summary": "t3 makes binding format-aware (recorded format, else v1 for accepted, v2 for pending), records taskIdentityFormat on new acceptances, refuses cross-format reuse, and raises every format/identity refusal of a submission as one rejection. Deviation from the LLD: reviewAssignments in assessment.ts (the pending scope-submission path) also collects refusals and the reuse check defaults to the attempt's bind format. Fixtures that demote accepted attempts drop the new field; the publication fixture now resolves its temp repo path (macOS /var symlink). Commits c34ae2cd9 and 9acbf7d3d.",
